sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Requester as 👤 Requester
    participant Gateway as 🚪 API Gateway (Cloud Run)
    participant DB as 🗄️ PostgreSQL 15+ (RLS)
    participant PubSub as 📬 Cloud Pub/Sub
    participant Tasks as ⏱️ Cloud Tasks
    participant Router as 🧭 Routing Worker
    actor Agent as 🎧 Support Specialist

    Requester->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/tickets (X-Idempotency-Key)
    Gateway->>DB: INSERT INTO tickets (status='SUBMITTED', version=1)
    Gateway->>DB: INSERT INTO ticket_audit_ledger (SHA-256 trigger)
    Gateway->>PubSub: Publish TicketCreatedEvent
    Gateway->>Tasks: Schedule SLA Callbacks (50%, 75%, 100%)
    Gateway-->>Requester: 201 Created (ticket_id, ETag)

    PubSub->>Router: Consume TicketCreatedEvent
    Router->>DB: Query least-loaded agent with matching skills
    Router->>DB: UPDATE tickets SET assigned_agent_id, status='ASSIGNED', version=2
    Router->>PubSub: Publish TicketAssignedEvent
    Router-->>Agent: Notify in Workbench & Slack
